# keel TUI round 3's real check (scripts/test-keel-tui.sh): @mentions, a paste, the Git plugin's commands and panel,
# Fix mode's live diff, changes and Keep. Runs after scripts/keel-tui-check.tui (its flow waits at the contract gate).
@type What does @READ
@sleep 1200
@snap r3-01-mention-picker
@key tab
@type  say?
@key enter
@wait answer 120
@snap r3-02-mention-sent
@type Explain this:
@paste 40
@snap r3-03-paste-placeholder
@key enter
@wait answer 120
@snap r3-04-paste-answer
/git status
/git log
/git diff
@snap r3-05-git-commands
@key ctrl+g
@sleep 2000
@snap r3-06-git-panel
@key ctrl+g
/approve
@wait waiting 300
/next
/mode fix
Add the small helper the gate asks for.
@wait streaming 60
@snap r3-07-fix-live-diff
@wait answer 240
@sleep 1500
@snap r3-08-fix-changes
/changes
@snap r3-09-changes
/keep src/scores/helper_fix.py
@snap r3-10-keep
